      <div class="card" style="padding:1.5rem;margin-top:2rem;background:#f0f9ff;border-left:4px solid #00667c;">
        <h3 style="margin-top:0;">💡 Spice & Sail Health Tip</h3>
        <p style="margin:0;">Start antimalarials <strong>before</strong> arrival (Malarone: 1–2 days; Doxycycline: 1–2 days; Mefloquine: 2–3 weeks). Take with food. Set a daily phone alarm. Don't stop early — complete the full post-travel course. Message us on WhatsApp ({{ site.contact.whatsapp_display }}) if you need pharmacy directions or doctor referrals during your stay.</p>
